  "description": "It is a rainy day, so Lina, Adams and Milo play with the toy box inside! 🧸🚂🥁\nIn this English story for kids, children learn 7 new words: toys, teddy, blocks, puzzle, drum, train and tidy. Listen, repeat, and learn English with Lina, Adams and Milo the cat.\n\n📚 New words in this story:\n🧸 toys — ألعاب — les jouets\n🐻 teddy — دبدوب — le nounours\n🧱 blocks — مكعبات — les cubes\n🧩 puzzle — لغز / بازل — le puzzle\n🥁 drum — طبل — le tambour\n🚂 train — قطار — le train\n🧹 tidy — مرتب / نرتب — ranger\n\n👨‍👩‍👧 For parents: after the story, name your child's toys in English and tidy them up together. Pause after each new word and say it out loud. Perfect for ages 3 to 8 and for children learning English as a second language.\n\n🇲🇦 قصة باللغة الإنجليزية للأطفال لتعلم أسماء الألعاب وترتيب الغرفة.\n🇫🇷 Une histoire en anglais pour enfants pour apprendre les jouets et ranger sa chambre.\n\n🌙 Subscribe to Moon Tales Kids for a new English story every day!\n\n#EnglishForKids #KidsStories #LearnEnglish #MoonTalesKids",
